-price divided by 12.
+Prices are typed in euros (`12.99`, `1,299.00`) and kept in whole cents. Monthly costs are calculated from the plan price rounded to the nearest cent: for yearly plans, divide by 12; for weekly plans, multiply by 52 and divide by 12.
 
